<h3><u>Hussain no gham</u></h3>
                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><p><strong><u>Hussain no gham</u></strong></p>

<p>(Hussain no gham sheher sheher che. Hussain matam, gali gali che) x2</p>

<ol>
 <li>(A ghamme dilme, basave ene) x2 Dua-e-Zehra, maligayi che</li>
 <li>(Hawe to duniya amone samje, hawe to duniya amone jane) x2 Amara aka hussain mawla, amara mawla, ali ali che</li>
 <li>(Ho reno badro, ohad ne khandaq. Narai kheibar, ni kehrahi che) x2 Bahadori maa Ali na same batawo koni, barabari che</li>
 <li>(Furat upar, kari ne kabzo. Na bundh pani, jene pidho) x2 Wafaa-e-Abbas, saw wafaa che, furat sajda, kari rahi che</li>
 <li>(Jawaan-e-Akbar, na dil thi barchi. Ne kadhi mawla rarirea che) x2 Salaam sabre Hussain tamne, jigar ma barchi, rahi gayi che</li>
 <li>(Nihari Asghar, ne roze mehshar. Ajab nathi khud, khuda kahe pan) x2 Rubab tari matta ki keemat, behesht puri adhuri they che</li>
 <li>(Jarak dhemee thi bolo zainab, jarak dhemee jagaro zainab) x2 Ke lash maidan ma nihari sakina bibi, dari gayi che.</li>
 <li>(Mari jo zindan thi rihaai, Ali ni puttri rari ne boli) x2 Ke mara bhai ni ik nishani, aa kaid khana rahi gayi che</li>
</ol>

<p>(Hussain no gham sheher sheher che. Hussain matam, gali gali che) x2</p>
</p>